index, check the download in PowerShell by themselves: (Get-FileHash <zip>).Hash -eq (-split (Get-Content
SHA256SUMS))[0] prints True or False, as sha256sum --check does on Linux, where the line before showed the hash to
compare by eye (owner, 28-10-2026). The Nexus page's home lists the Windows Portable Suite under The suites, with a
link to the releases until it has a wiki. Both wikis, the Nexus page and the BC250 Bazzite Suite's, show a title as
