Changelog: 23-10-2026 15:45:14

CI's Qt runtime libraries no longer ask Ubuntu's mirror in every job: tools/ci-qt-libs.sh looks the libraries up on
the runner (ldconfig) and installs them only when one is missing, with apt's retries and timeouts, and the step stops
after 5 minutes. On 23-10-2026 apt-get update in that step hung the sameboy tests for 20 minutes, until the job's own
limit failed the run, and slowed the other jobs to several minutes each.

