Changelog: 19-10-2026 16:16:14

tools/sync_icons.py converts new category icons. An image dropped in icons/<category>/ named <category>-<size>
(any extension) becomes that size's icon, one by another name all four; each is scaled, saved as WebP (the 128 px
one as PNG) under the category's names and the dropped file removed, before the copies are written. --category with
--from converts an image from elsewhere, --size only the sizes named. --check also lists dropped images not yet
converted, and a category icon that is missing stops it. Simple Demo Tool's Convert icons… is a window for it.
The sustainable category has the owner's new icon, converted this way and copied to its apps and portal tiles.
Tests: tools/tests/test_icons.py.

